<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 77 0 R
/E (Four observations. The feed alternates between two visual registers without a connective narrative. Colour is behaving like an emerging system that has not yet been formalised. Geographic variety lacks the emotional anchoring that the brand's best creator captions already demonstrate. Lingerie and ready-to-wear coexist on the feed without a storytelling logic that connects them.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
101 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 77 0 R
