184 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/P 80 0 R
/T (This distribution is more balanced than it was in earlier periods of the account's history, reflecting a deliberate increase in Reels output. The shift is directionally correct: Reels generate an average organic reach rate of approximately 30.81% in 2026, compared to substantially lower rates for static posts and carousels, making them the primary format for discovery and new audience acquisition. The question is not whether to produce more Reels but what those Reels are doing narratively.)
/E (This distribution is more balanced than it was in earlier periods of the account's history, reflecting a deliberate increase in Reels output. The shift is directionally correct: Reels generate an average organic reach rate of approximately 30.81% in 2026, compared to substantially lower rates for static posts and carousels, making them the primary format for discovery and new audience acquisition. The question is not whether to produce more Reels but what those Reels are doing narratively.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
185 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/P 80 0 R
/T (The account uses no hashtags. This is a deliberate positioning choice consistent with premium brand conventions: hashtags signal mass-market reach-seeking behaviour that conflicts with a curated, exclusivity-oriented positioning. The choice is correct for the brand's stage and segment. Caption length varies significantly, from single elegant sentences to short descriptive paragraphs, without a consistent structural logic. Call-to-action language appears in some posts and is absent in others. These patterns are discussed in detail in Section 5.)
/E (The account uses no hashtags. This is a deliberate positioning choice consistent with premium brand conventions: hashtags signal mass-market reach-seeking behaviour that conflicts with a curated, exclusivity-oriented positioning. The choice is correct for the brand's stage and segment. Caption length varies significantly, from single elegant sentences to short descriptive paragraphs, without a consistent structural logic. Call-to-action language appears in some posts and is absent in others. These patterns are discussed in detail in Section 5.)
/Pg 14 0 R
