/T (Five words. No product name, no tag, no CTA. This works because it does not compete with the image: it amplifies the atmosphere that the image is already creating. The risk of this register is that it is easy to write and therefore easy to overuse. When every caption is a short atmospheric fragment, the register loses its distinctiveness. Used selectively, on images that are strong enough to carry the weight, it is effective and consistent with the brand voice.)
