<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 84 0 R
/E (This is the most ambitious caption in the audit window and the most complex to evaluate. It is narrative in a way that none of the other captions attempt: it builds a scene, introduces tension, and resolves with a brand statement that functions almost as a manifesto line. The structure is correct and the writing is genuinely good. The question is whether the corresponding image earns the weight of the caption. When caption ambition outpaces image ambition, the reader feels the mismatch: the caption promises something that the image does not deliver. This caption works best when paired with imagery that is equally constructed and equally atmospheric.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [5]
>>
