345 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 88 0 R
/E (What Love Stories has resolved, and Undress Code has not yet fully resolved, is the two-register tension. Love Stories alternates between high-production editorial carousels with strong colour blocking and candid creator content with high engagement, and these two registers are held together by a caption voice that is consistently playful, direct, and instantly recognisable. A person who encounters Love Stories content in Explore identifies it as Love Stories before reading a word.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
346 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 88 0 R
/E (The lesson for Undress Code is not aesthetic: Love Stories is warmer and more maximalist, while Undress Code's visual world is cooler and more precise. The lesson is structural: a caption voice strong enough and consistent enough to hold two registers within one recognisable identity. Undress Code has the stronger visual production. It is building toward an equivalently strong narrative spine.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
