/E (Cou Cou is the closest available benchmark for the specific tension Undress Code is navigating: how to make the immediate register feel as considered as the editorial register. Cou Cou's answer is a creative director's vision so consistent that even a mirror selfie in their feed looks like a Cou Cou image. Every image, however casual it appears, has been art-directed within a defined palette \(pale cotton, natural light, lived-in domesticity\) and talent direction \(movement over stillness, the body as comfortable rather than performed\).)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
