364 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 89 0 R
/E (The performance data from this audit window is not a warning signal. It is a map. The posts that reach 1,441 likes are not anomalies: they are demonstrations of what the account can do when image, caption, and atmosphere align. The work ahead is not creative invention. It is system-building: translating the instincts that produced those top performers into a repeatable content logic that applies across every format, every register, and every week of the content calendar.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
