<<
/Title (This distribution is more balanced than it was in earlier periods of the account's history, reflecting a deliberate increase in Reels output. The shift is directionally correct: Reels generate an average organic reach rate of approximately 30.81% in 2026, compared to substantially lower rates for static posts and carousels, making them the primary format for discovery and new audience acquisition. The question is not whether to produce more Reels but what those Reels are doing narratively.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1469 0 R
/Next 1485 0 R
>>
