/Title (The account uses no hashtags. This is a deliberate positioning choice consistent with premium brand conventions: hashtags signal mass-market reach-seeking behaviour that conflicts with a curated, exclusivity-oriented positioning. The choice is correct for the brand's stage and segment. Caption length varies significantly, from single elegant sentences to short descriptive paragraphs, without a consistent structural logic. Call-to-action language appears in some posts and is absent in others. These patterns are discussed in detail in Section 5.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1485 0 R
/Next 1497 0 R
>>
